basically, any of our products,

00:04:15.575 --> 00:04:16.450
which is super sweet.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:19.033
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Not only Google
Cloud platform, but actually,

00:04:19.033 --> 00:04:19.540
