00:04:38.242 --> 00:04:39.700
Which bug tracker
is it working on?

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:40.750
I need to go find it.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.500
Now, there's just one
place for you to go.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:44.510
If you had to submit a
bug or check on a bug,

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.690
this is the one
